<title>UK: BOS Intl sets $75 million one-year FRN.</title>
<headline>BOS Intl sets $75 million one-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN Amro Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BOS INTERNATIONAL (AUSTRALIA) LTD</p>
<p> GUARANTOR GOVERNOR AND COMPANY OF BANK OF SCOTLAND</p>
<p> AMT    $75 MLN	 BASE	 1M LIBOR  MATURITY    29.JUL.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     -0.03 PCT PAY DATE    29.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    ISS PRICE  UNDISC    LISTING     NONE</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA3/A+    DENOMS (M) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES	LAUNCHED OF EURO DEBT ISSUANCE PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
